Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous “CIA Gateway
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Report” contains a test
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,most summaries skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Three observers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One hidden target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One sees it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One searches the immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One searches the immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Their descriptions are compared
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,only after the session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like science
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Recommendation H
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in a 1983 report
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,prepared for the United
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,States Army and later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,released through the CIA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,part that keeps the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,file open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The document lays out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The outcome remains unresolved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,on the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you authorize the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,test —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or stop the program?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment AUTHORIZE or STOP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The full Gateway investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is linked below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow NOESIS for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,next file.
